      `it was approved under subsection 254(1) as it read immediately before the day on which subsection 3(1) of 2018, c. 21 comes into force` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`2018 c 21 s 10 the thing is deemed to be approved, as the same kind of thing, under section 254.01 as enacted by section 4` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF kind EQUALS `2018 c 21 s 10 something else` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Any approved instrument, approved screening device or approved container"
